        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 3.9,
          "en": "Instructor: The code we have thus far",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.9,
          "end": 6.03,
          "en": "is not bad and it does its job.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.03,
          "end": 9.27,
          "en": "And if our application were as simple as it is here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.27,
          "end": 11.31,
          "en": "it would be perfectly fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.31,
          "end": 14.52,
          "en": "But in bigger applications and maybe even in this one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.52,
          "end": 17.61,
          "en": "we already have a quite big component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.61,
          "end": 20.61,
          "en": "with a lot of code that is only indirectly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.61,
          "end": 22.68,
          "en": "related to the user interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.68,
          "end": 25.17,
          "en": "Of course, we wanna send a request when a button is clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.17,
          "end": 27.48,
          "en": "and we wanna display that response data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.48,
          "end": 30.48,
          "en": "but for example, transforming the result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.48,
          "end": 31.89,
          "en": "transforming the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.89,
          "end": 35.61,
          "en": "we can do it here, it's not inherently bad,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.61,
          "end": 39.72,
