          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.14,
          "end": 46.35,
          "en": "that do the heavy lifting, the dirty work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.35,
          "end": 49.59,
          "en": "and your components are relatively lean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.59,
          "end": 51.39,
          "en": "as lean as they can be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.39,
          "end": 55.38,
          "en": "and are mostly concerned with template related work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.38,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "So with things like there is fetching property and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 61.8,
