          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 64.47,
          "en": "the posts service here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.47,
          "end": 67.043,
          "en": "And I'll create it by exporting a class PostsService,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.55,
          "end": 70.32,
          "en": "and we need to provide that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.32,
          "end": 72.81,
          "en": "and for that we can use two approaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.81,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "We can use @Injectable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 77.67,
          "en": "which you need to import from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.67,
          "end": 81.15,
          "en": "And there we can pass an object and set provided into root,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.15,
          "end": 83.97,
          "en": "which is the more modern and recommended approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.97,
          "end": 85.89,
          "en": "But you could also provide it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.89,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "in the providers array of the app module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 91.11,
          "en": "and this also wouldn't be bad or a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.11,
          "end": 93.15299999999999,
          "en": "Here, however I will use this approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.22999999999999,
          "end": 96.69,
          "en": "Now what's my idea behind that service?",
          "zh": ""
        },
